('302','1','2021-01-23 14:12:09','2021-01-23 14:12:09','<p>Northstar CRM is designed for small teams that need one place to manage leads, follow-ups, and sales stages. The layout keeps the pipeline easy to read, and the contact records stay simple enough for non-technical teams to adopt without a long setup period.</p><p>What stands out most is the way it helps keep conversations and next steps visible. Instead of scattering notes across spreadsheets and inboxes, the team can stay centered on the same record and move deals forward with less confusion.</p>','Northstar CRM Review','A clear CRM review focused on contact tracking, pipeline visibility, and everyday team organization.','trash','open','closed','','volutpat-lacus-iaoreet-non-curabitur__trashed','','','2026-07-30 13:35:38','2026-07-30 17:35:38','','0','https://startersites.io/elementor/product-reviews/?post_type=blc-product-review&#038;p=302','0','blc-product-review','','0'),
