('320','1','2021-01-23 15:13:20','2021-01-23 15:13:20','<p>Pulse Social Scheduler is built for teams that need a calm, predictable way to plan social posts. The calendar view makes it easy to see what is going out and when, while the scheduling tools reduce the daily scramble of posting by hand.</p><p>It is especially useful when several people touch the same content plan. Drafts, approvals, and scheduled posts stay visible in one place, which helps avoid missed updates and duplicate work.</p>','Pulse Social Scheduler Review','A simple review of a social media scheduling tool built for planning posts and keeping campaigns organized.','trash','open','closed','','adipiscing-commodo-elitat-imperdiet__trashed','','','2026-07-30 13:35:38','2026-07-30 17:35:38','','0','https://startersites.io/elementor/product-reviews/?post_type=blc-product-review&#038;p=320','0','blc-product-review','','0'),
