('323','1','2021-01-23 15:17:45','2021-01-23 15:17:45','<p>BuildMint Website Builder is aimed at people who want to launch a clean site without wrestling with a heavy build process. The templates are easy to shape, and the editing flow keeps basic pages moving quickly from idea to publish.</p><p>For small businesses, that matters. A builder like this is most valuable when it helps you move fast, keep the site tidy, and make simple updates without waiting on a developer for every change.</p>','BuildMint Website Builder Review','A review of a website builder that focuses on speed, templates, and quick launch workflows.','trash','open','closed','','commodo-vestibulum-sedar-cunon__trashed','','','2026-07-30 13:35:38','2026-07-30 17:35:38','','0','https://startersites.io/elementor/product-reviews/?post_type=blc-product-review&#038;p=323','0','blc-product-review','','0'),
