('328','1','2021-01-23 15:30:34','2021-01-23 15:30:34','<p>FlowBolt Automation is meant for teams that want to cut repetitive work without building a complicated system. It handles triggers, simple rules, and handoffs in a way that keeps processes moving and reduces the number of small tasks people have to remember.</p><p>The value here is not in doing everything. It is in automating the jobs that steal time every week, like sending alerts, moving records, and kicking off routine follow-ups.</p>','FlowBolt Automation Review','A practical look at automation software for teams that want fewer manual steps and better workflow control.','trash','open','closed','','congue-quisque-egestas-diam-onarcu__trashed','','','2026-07-30 13:35:38','2026-07-30 17:35:38','','0','https://startersites.io/elementor/product-reviews/?post_type=blc-product-review&#038;p=328','0','blc-product-review','','0'),
